{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02143",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.06,
      "end_seconds": 5.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.62,
      "end_seconds": 11.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 13.97,
      "end_seconds": 19.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.33,
      "end_seconds": 23.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "good, that'll be useful pull up a chair"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.08,
      "end_seconds": 38.8,
      "duration_seconds": 9.72,
      "text": "well, I've been having tingling in the foot. My family kept telling me to to get it checked"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 42.05,
      "end_seconds": 49.95,
      "duration_seconds": 7.9,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Saturation 97 percent, blood pressure 124 over 72, pulse 70. Temp 36.7 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.72,
      "end_seconds": 55.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Good, thank you. Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.0,
      "end_seconds": 59.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "probably about four days yeah"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.78,
      "end_seconds": 64.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.98,
      "end_seconds": 66.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "I'd say mild"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.47,
      "end_seconds": 74.83,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "Erm, and the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 74.93,
      "end_seconds": 80.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.91,
      "end_seconds": 95.98,
      "duration_seconds": 14.07,
      "text": "I was getting to that! I've also had pain out of proportion oh, and a tight swollen leg that's been about the same, four weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.83,
      "end_seconds": 103.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "any severe pain in the lower leg after a fracture as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.72,
      "end_seconds": 110.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Yeah. One week, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.71,
      "end_seconds": 118.44,
      "duration_seconds": 6.73,
      "text": "Have you had tingling in the foot before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.94,
      "end_seconds": 126.49,
      "duration_seconds": 7.55,
      "text": "Right, a bit, about six months ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 128.58,
      "end_seconds": 132.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Yes, that's right, that's how it was."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.95,
      "end_seconds": 141.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Any wound infection, chest pain or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.13,
      "end_seconds": 147.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "I haven't had wound infection, chest pain or fever, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.34,
      "end_seconds": 151.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.92,
      "end_seconds": 155.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.32,
      "end_seconds": 160.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.41,
      "end_seconds": 167.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.25,
      "end_seconds": 174.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.59,
      "end_seconds": 198.65,
      "duration_seconds": 22.06,
      "text": "I've got heart disease it's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it i have heart failure, for about ten years my neighbour said I should get it looked at a neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.05,
      "end_seconds": 200.98,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.86,
      "end_seconds": 207.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "I've, I've got diabetes i have an irregular heartbeat"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.8,
      "end_seconds": 220.4,
      "duration_seconds": 11.6,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Right, so an irregular heartbeat is already on your record. We'll keep that that in mind today. Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.21,
      "end_seconds": 225.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day for my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.39,
      "end_seconds": 230.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Since when have you been taking it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.0,
      "end_seconds": 236.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "for six months. Spironolactone i take it once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.68,
      "end_seconds": 243.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.6,
      "end_seconds": 253.46,
      "duration_seconds": 8.86,
      "text": "25 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box. Glimepiride. I take it 2 milligrams, before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_6",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 254.87,
      "end_seconds": 264.08,
      "duration_seconds": 9.21,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the glimepiride was 4 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.27,
      "end_seconds": 269.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Hm. Do you have the latest prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.92,
      "end_seconds": 278.58,
      "duration_seconds": 7.66,
      "text": "No, I left it at home. I take bisoprolol, 2.5 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.09,
      "end_seconds": 291.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.04,
      "end_seconds": 295.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 296.49,
      "end_seconds": 304.53,
      "duration_seconds": 8.04,
      "text": "actually, I remember she had some kind of reaction to tramadol before. I couldn't swear to it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.7,
      "end_seconds": 307.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "I don't remember that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.77,
      "end_seconds": 315.99,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "Alright, so that's unclear. I'll record what each of you said. What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.06,
      "end_seconds": 321.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.72,
      "end_seconds": 324.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.28,
      "end_seconds": 329.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.01,
      "end_seconds": 333.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "what does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.87,
      "end_seconds": 338.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.42,
      "end_seconds": 345.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.41,
      "end_seconds": 347.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.29,
      "end_seconds": 349.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.42,
      "end_seconds": 370.79,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "The calf is tense and shiny, and stretching the toes makes the pain much worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 374.72,
      "end_seconds": 377.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 389.59,
      "end_seconds": 420.58,
      "duration_seconds": 30.99,
      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. This is probably possible compartment syndrome needing urgent surgery. We shouldn't forget a deep vein thrombosis. Let's book measuring the pressure in the leg to look into possible compartment syndrome. Remove the cast now, you are going to theatre for a decompression. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 422.56,
      "end_seconds": 432.4,
      "duration_seconds": 9.84,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 433.07,
      "end_seconds": 434.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Alright, I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 436.48,
      "end_seconds": 448.23,
      "duration_seconds": 11.75,
      "text": "the thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency. Let's plan a check straight away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 449.2,
      "end_seconds": 451.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Alright, I'll be back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 457.11,
      "end_seconds": 461.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "right, that's the plan do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 462.66,
      "end_seconds": 466.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "mm, no, that's all. Thanks a lot"
    }
  ]
}